cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GENChase: a development and research working environment, with a studio of seeded scientific simulations built for print"
message: "If you use GENChase or a plate made with it, cite this software and also cite the researchers named in the technique's own credit line. If you use the vortex-collapse formulas behind its three-vortex-bound, parallelogram-lock, quincunx-lock and double-triangle-bound tabs, cite the paper Minimal Winding in the Self-Similar Collapse of Point Vortices (Remark 2, Propositions 2 and 3) and the classical sources it credits."
type: software
authors:
